WEBVTT

00:02.790 --> 00:04.500
A long, long time ago.

00:04.750 --> 00:07.630
A story from about a hundred years ago.

00:08.590 --> 00:13.640
Nadja, guided by destiny, arrived in Switzerland.

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
NAAJA

00:17.470 --> 00:18.770
Nadja,

00:18.890 --> 00:21.440
With your eyes

00:18.890 --> 00:21.440
Kimi no hitomi ni wa

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
Nadja,

00:21.440 --> 00:22.650
NAAJA

00:22.690 --> 00:24.940
What do you see?

00:22.690 --> 00:24.940
Nani ga mieru

00:24.980 --> 00:27.860
Shining in the far distance,

00:24.980 --> 00:27.860
Haruka tooku hikaru

00:27.860 --> 00:30.240
The door to the future,

00:27.860 --> 00:30.240
Mirai no tobira

00:31.160 --> 00:34.620
That's what I'm searching for

00:31.160 --> 00:34.620
Sagashite iru

00:34.620 --> 00:41.830
Tomorrow's Nadja

00:42.540 --> 00:46.040
If everyone could meet with a smile

00:42.540 --> 00:46.040
Minna egao de aetara

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

00:46.130 --> 00:49.380
Arasoi mo kitto nakunaru

00:49.420 --> 00:52.630
It could be so much more fun

00:49.420 --> 00:52.630
Konna ni mo tanoshi kunaru

00:52.680 --> 00:56.100
The world is wide, but it's still one

00:52.680 --> 00:56.100
Sekai wa hiroi kedo hitotsu ne

00:56.470 --> 00:59.770
I can't see the end of the journey

00:56.470 --> 00:59.770
Tabi no owari wa mienai

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
God is the only one who could possibly know

00:59.890 --> 01:03.230
Kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:03.400 --> 01:06.980
Itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:07.020 --> 01:09.150
I will go waving

01:07.020 --> 01:09.150
Te wo furinagara

01:09.230 --> 01:15.910
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

01:09.230 --> 01:15.910
Toki ni wa BURUU ni naru hi mo aru kedo

01:15.950 --> 01:18.660
But I won't look back

01:15.950 --> 01:18.660
Ushiro mukanai

01:18.990 --> 01:23.960
Until the day my dream comes true

01:18.990 --> 01:23.960
Yume ga kanau hi made

01:24.250 --> 01:27.670
Nadja, Your smile

01:24.250 --> 01:27.670
NAAJA kimi no hohoemi wa

01:27.750 --> 01:31.090
Nadja, gives me courage

01:27.750 --> 01:31.090
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

01:31.130 --> 01:34.050
Under the blue sky,

01:31.130 --> 01:34.050
Aoi sora no shita de

01:34.180 --> 01:37.010
I will find the place

01:34.180 --> 01:37.010
Ashita no yukue

01:37.300 --> 01:41.230
where my future lies

01:37.300 --> 01:41.230
Mitsukeru kara

02:15.990 --> 02:17.700
﻿Ah! You're going to take that one?

02:31.630 --> 02:32.800
﻿Francis...

02:33.510 --> 02:35.260
﻿We'll meet again, won't we?

02:36.090 --> 02:37.130
Hey, everyone!

02:37.340 --> 02:38.340
Come over here and see!

02:38.680 --> 02:39.260
﻿What! What!

02:40.220 --> 02:41.010
﻿Wow!!!

02:52.360 --> 02:53.570
﻿How beautiful...

03:05.810 --> 03:10.720
A Lie at the Alpine Flower Festival

03:16.630 --> 03:18.970
﻿Right. We, the Dandelion Troupe...

03:18.970 --> 03:20.970
﻿...are going to make this festival really fun!

03:21.350 --> 03:22.930
﻿Nadja, start the troupe's theme song!

03:26.060 --> 03:27.020
﻿This song...

03:39.530 --> 03:42.070
﻿Master! Stop the car! Stop the car, please!

03:53.090 --> 03:54.920
﻿Yes! They're doing that dance!

04:45.220 --> 04:46.510
﻿People of the village!

04:48.390 --> 04:50.020
﻿At tomorrow's Flower Festival...

04:50.180 --> 04:52.690
﻿We, the Dandelion Troupe, will also be participating...

04:52.940 --> 04:55.110
﻿And, we'll do our best to make this festival fun!

04:55.310 --> 04:57.150
﻿We look forward to your patronage!

05:13.080 --> 05:14.750
﻿Hey, you! Wait!

05:15.040 --> 05:17.090
﻿Don't go off by yourself!

05:20.420 --> 05:21.010
﻿Gotcha!

05:26.640 --> 05:28.600
﻿Wow! A big cat!

05:28.720 --> 05:30.640
﻿No^ it's not. It's a lion.

05:30.810 --> 05:32.520
﻿I thought lions were brown?

05:33.690 --> 05:38.520
﻿Chocolat and Cream are a rare pair of black and white, twin lions.

05:40.280 --> 05:42.150
﻿Hey, is it all right to touch them?

05:43.030 --> 05:44.450
Here, I'll let you hold him.

05:44.450 --> 05:45.820
﻿Watch out!!!

05:46.620 --> 05:48.320
﻿Hey, hey, you're going to get run over now!

05:48.490 --> 05:49.780
﻿Ah! It's Zabie!

05:49.790 --> 05:50.790
﻿Zabie's coming!

05:58.340 --> 05:59.960
﻿You guys scare too easy!

06:00.130 --> 06:02.170
﻿You're all a bunch of scaredy-cats!

06:02.170 --> 06:05.340
﻿I'm going to tell your brothers on you!

06:05.340 --> 06:06.180
﻿What did you say!

06:06.180 --> 06:08.090
﻿Stop it! That's dangerous!

06:13.180 --> 06:15.020
﻿Hey, do you want to have a ride on this?

06:21.480 --> 06:24.940
﻿A kid's game like that?
I, Kennosuke, am not interested.

06:26.410 --> 06:27.410
You're scared.

06:27.950 --> 06:30.030
﻿You're bigger than me, but you're scared.

06:30.030 --> 06:31.160
﻿Whaaaa?!

06:32.750 --> 06:34.040
Geez, this kid's annoying!

06:34.040 --> 06:36.290
﻿This feeling reminds me so much of THAT guy!

06:37.040 --> 06:38.460
﻿What did you say!

06:38.460 --> 06:39.210
﻿You picking a fight?

06:42.210 --> 06:43.300
﻿You want to ride it, don't you?

06:45.550 --> 06:47.470
﻿This is the best!

06:54.020 --> 06:55.680
﻿Ow-ow-ow...!

06:58.480 --> 07:00.100
﻿All right! This, time it's Rita's turn.

07:14.580 --> 07:15.700
﻿One more time?

07:15.700 --> 07:17.080
﻿Okay!

07:17.080 --> 07:19.170
﻿Let's do something even more fun.

07:19.460 --> 07:20.580
﻿Fun, you say?

07:21.000 --> 07:24.000
﻿Far up that river, there's a secret waterfall.

07:24.210 --> 07:25.300
﻿A secret waterfall?

07:25.760 --> 07:27.840
﻿If you want to go, I can take you there.

07:27.970 --> 07:29.090
﻿Yeah! Let's go!

07:30.260 --> 07:32.140
﻿This way!

07:32.140 --> 07:33.140
﻿No women allowed.

07:34.010 --> 07:34.970
﻿It's too dangerous.

07:35.100 --> 07:38.180
﻿Rita, take Chocolat and Cream and go back.

07:47.150 --> 07:49.150
﻿Is that girl all right?

07:49.150 --> 07:51.240
﻿Rita will be fine. Let's go.

07:53.030 --> 07:54.830
﻿Whoa! Wait!

07:56.660 --> 07:59.370
﻿You're really good at dancing.

07:59.500 --> 08:02.130
﻿That's because I'm a dancer
for the Dandelion Troupe.

08:02.330 --> 08:03.630
﻿No wonder...!

08:03.960 --> 08:05.040
﻿Thanks to the Troupe...

08:05.130 --> 08:07.550
﻿...the Flower Festival tomorrow will be really fun!

08:07.550 --> 08:08.590
﻿Right, right!

08:08.630 --> 08:11.840
﻿With only the men from the village, it's not worth asking them to go!

08:11.360 --> 08:12.620
What?!

08:12.640 --> 08:15.050
﻿Well, with only you girls inviting us every year...

08:15.470 --> 08:18.060
﻿..it's not worth the trouble to dance!

08:18.060 --> 08:19.020
﻿That's terrible!

08:19.310 --> 08:20.980
﻿You started it!

08:21.150 --> 08:22.480
﻿At this Flower Festival...

08:22.730 --> 08:26.270
﻿Women are supposed to ask the men to dance.

08:26.360 --> 08:27.190
﻿I see!

08:27.190 --> 08:28.440
﻿You young people over there!

08:28.440 --> 08:31.240
﻿Stop talking, and come help!

08:31.360 --> 08:31.990
Yup, yup!

08:31.990 --> 08:32.990
﻿I heard you.

08:38.040 --> 08:39.620
﻿Come over here, if you can!

08:39.620 --> 08:41.330
﻿Wait, you!

08:45.290 --> 08:47.130
﻿Attacking without warning! That's dirty!

08:50.380 --> 08:52.880
﻿What? They went into such a place?

08:53.890 --> 08:55.350
﻿Ah! Rita! Wait!

09:01.190 --> 09:02.390
﻿Rita~!

09:04.690 --> 09:06.190
Hey, I said, wait!

09:09.650 --> 09:10.900
﻿It can't be helped...

09:11.950 --> 09:13.450
﻿Oh? These berries look good.

09:17.990 --> 09:19.290
﻿You dummy!

09:19.290 --> 09:22.040
﻿You can't eat those until they turn purple!

09:22.040 --> 09:23.750
﻿Your mouth is all red!

09:23.920 --> 09:26.330
﻿Urahg! I'm a vampire!

09:28.420 --> 09:29.920
﻿Wait up!

09:30.920 --> 09:32.670
﻿Take this!

09:33.130 --> 09:35.340
﻿That's definitely Kennosuke's voice. Let's go!

09:46.480 --> 09:48.440
﻿Yeah, it's great to be with just the boys.

09:50.440 --> 09:54.570
﻿I'm in the Dandelion Troupe, so I'm always traveling you see.

09:55.160 --> 09:57.620
﻿I don't have a chance to play with other boys.

09:58.200 --> 09:59.410
﻿I see.

10:06.460 --> 10:09.420
﻿If we go across, we can get really close to the waterfall.

10:09.710 --> 10:10.590
﻿There!

10:10.880 --> 10:12.090
Okay, my turn.

10:16.800 --> 10:18.050
﻿There!

10:26.560 --> 10:27.480
﻿Rita! You...!

10:28.940 --> 10:30.650
Don't, Rita! Stay still!

10:32.030 --> 10:33.820
﻿Rita! Where are you?!

10:33.940 --> 10:34.820
﻿Rita!

10:36.820 --> 10:38.200
﻿Don't move, Rita!

10:38.450 --> 10:39.740
﻿I'm coming, okay!

10:39.740 --> 10:40.870
﻿Rita!

10:41.290 --> 10:43.040
﻿Rita!!!

11:07.520 --> 11:08.190
﻿Rita!

11:08.190 --> 11:10.150
﻿Rita! Rita!!!

11:21.990 --> 11:23.240
﻿Rita!!!

11:32.800 --> 11:33.460
﻿Rita!

11:33.460 --> 11:34.170
﻿Are you all right?

11:38.430 --> 11:40.010
Y﻿ou have to take those clothes off.

11:40.720 --> 11:43.720
﻿That's why I told you that women weren't allowed to come...

11:45.100 --> 11:46.140
﻿Come over here.

11:47.350 --> 11:48.600
﻿Zabie, thank you.

11:48.600 --> 11:50.980
﻿Rita owes her life to you.

11:52.190 --> 11:54.820
﻿You should take off your shirt, too. It needs to be wrung out.

11:54.820 --> 11:56.400
﻿That's all right! I’m fine!

11:56.530 --> 11:58.690
﻿Huh! You're going to catch cold.

11:59.910 --> 12:00.740
﻿What???

12:01.370 --> 12:03.030
﻿Ah! There's two of Cream!

12:05.490 --> 12:06.620
﻿Could it be..

12:06.620 --> 12:08.870
﻿Chocolat is actually white lion?

12:13.710 --> 12:15.040
﻿No way~!

12:17.420 --> 12:20.130
﻿A black and white pair of twin lions...

12:20.720 --> 12:22.720
﻿Master, you were telling a lie!

12:22.720 --> 12:25.100
﻿I absolutely hate liars!

12:25.760 --> 12:28.220
﻿Ah! Zabie's dripping wet!

12:28.560 --> 12:30.270
﻿I bet you fell in the river!

12:30.270 --> 12:33.190
﻿That's what you get for acting like a boy when you're a girl!

12:35.070 --> 12:36.860
﻿That's for acting like a boy!

12:36.860 --> 12:38.150
﻿Like a boy!

12:38.650 --> 12:42.320
﻿Nyah! Nyah! Drippy drippy Zabie!

12:42.450 --> 12:44.490
﻿Drippy drippy Zabie!

12:45.370 --> 12:46.740
Then Zabie's really...

12:47.200 --> 12:49.330
﻿Hey, Zabie... You're really a girl...

12:50.210 --> 12:51.040
﻿Zabie!

12:51.670 --> 12:53.000
Zabie...﻿

12:59.050 --> 13:00.380
﻿Good grief!

13:00.670 --> 13:03.430
﻿Taking Rita to a place like that!

13:03.590 --> 13:05.850
﻿I told her not to follow us...

13:05.890 --> 13:07.640
﻿Rita, followed us on her own.

13:07.760 --> 13:09.600
﻿If you were told not to follow,

13:09.600 --> 13:12.440
﻿it just makes you want to follow even more, right?

13:12.640 --> 13:14.900
Well, they're safe, so why don't we forget it?

13:15.270 --> 13:17.020
﻿There you go! You're turning black.

13:17.110 --> 13:18.730
﻿Aren't you happy, Chocolat?

13:20.070 --> 13:21.780
﻿And, Master was lying!

13:22.150 --> 13:25.240
﻿Hey... there are good lies and bad lies.

13:25.620 --> 13:26.780
﻿To say that Cream and Chocolat...

13:26.870 --> 13:28.780
﻿...are a pair of black and white twin lions...

13:28.790 --> 13:32.210
﻿...is to make the customers happy. In other words, a good lie!

13:32.460 --> 13:33.920
﻿What the heck is that?

13:34.250 --> 13:35.630
﻿A white lie isn't really a lie?

13:36.710 --> 13:38.420
﻿How about another bowl of soup?

13:38.460 --> 13:40.460
﻿It'll warm you up.

13:42.380 --> 13:45.130
﻿But, I wonder if Zabie is all right...

13:45.300 --> 13:46.800
﻿She might have caught a cold.

13:46.800 --> 13:47.800
﻿I don't mean that!

13:48.100 --> 13:50.180
﻿She's probably really worried...

13:50.390 --> 13:53.890
﻿...lying to you about being a boy. Worried about tricking you, Kennosuke.

13:54.520 --> 13:57.020
﻿I hate liars!

13:57.560 --> 13:58.480
You may be right...

14:13.750 --> 14:14.750
﻿Hey, you!

14:14.870 --> 14:16.670
﻿What did you do with my pencil!

14:16.670 --> 14:18.130
﻿I don't know!

14:18.290 --> 14:20.250
﻿If you're going to fight, go outside!

14:20.420 --> 14:22.090
﻿It'll be dinner time soon.

14:22.590 --> 14:24.170
﻿I said I don't know!

14:24.170 --> 14:26.380
﻿If you don't tell me quickly, you're going to get it!

14:29.350 --> 14:31.390
﻿Damn it! Look what you did!

14:31.390 --> 14:34.270
﻿It's your fault! You borrowed my stuff without asking.

14:34.270 --> 14:35.480
﻿Shut your mouth!

14:35.480 --> 14:36.480
﻿What did you say!

14:36.480 --> 14:37.520
﻿Just because you're older!

14:37.520 --> 14:38.730
﻿That's enough!

14:39.150 --> 14:42.570
﻿You're not getting any dinner tonight, now get out!

14:42.820 --> 14:43.650
﻿It's all your fault!

14:43.650 --> 14:45.070
﻿It's your fault, Bro! What did you say!

14:45.070 --> 14:47.450
﻿Why am I gonna get kicked out too?

14:47.450 --> 14:50.410
﻿How can you just sit there and watch your brothers fight?

14:49.930 --> 14:52.310
But, it doesn't have anything to do with me!

14:52.040 --> 14:53.160
﻿Be quiet!

14:53.450 --> 14:54.370
﻿Huh?

14:54.660 --> 14:56.040
﻿G-Good evening...

14:56.330 --> 14:58.080
﻿My name is Nadja...

14:58.210 --> 14:59.750
﻿And, I'm Kennosuke.

14:59.880 --> 15:01.460
﻿We're Zabie's friends.

15:01.960 --> 15:03.840
﻿Oh, my! That's what happened?

15:03.960 --> 15:07.380
We were worried that she might have caught a cold.

15:07.430 --> 15:11.180
﻿I thought she fooled around and fell in the river...

15:11.260 --> 15:13.180
﻿We didn't thank her properly, either...

15:13.310 --> 15:14.310
﻿Where's Zabie?

15:14.810 --> 15:18.520
﻿She just went upstairs. What is she thinking?

15:19.860 --> 15:21.860
﻿We have four boys...

15:21.860 --> 15:24.070
﻿...and Zabie is the only girl so...

15:24.400 --> 15:27.030
﻿Her real name is Zabie?

15:28.320 --> 15:30.990
﻿Thanks to that, she grew up just like a boy.

15:31.620 --> 15:35.660
﻿I thought she would become more womanly when she grew up, but...

15:36.250 --> 15:37.710
﻿Recently...

15:37.710 --> 15:40.000
...she's become even more boyish.

15:42.750 --> 15:45.710
﻿And, the kids in the neighbourhood won't play with her.

15:47.630 --> 15:49.590
﻿Ahh! How pretty!

15:50.140 --> 15:53.510
﻿I made one this year too, in the hopes that she'd at last become more like a girl.

15:53.510 --> 15:55.390
﻿To think that this festival dress..

15:55.390 --> 15:57.770
...is ﻿going to go to waste again..

15:59.980 --> 16:01.100
﻿Zabie is...

16:01.770 --> 16:05.320
﻿You don't think that Zabie wants to be like a regular girl?

16:05.320 --> 16:06.150
﻿What?

16:06.320 --> 16:08.240
﻿But, she's embarrassed by that...

16:08.240 --> 16:10.360
﻿So, she's deliberately acting more boyish.

16:10.820 --> 16:12.200
I wonder if you re right...

16:12.570 --> 16:14.450
I﻿'m sure that's it. Don't you think so, Kennosuke?

16:14.790 --> 16:16.910
﻿I don't understand a girl's feelings...

16:17.660 --> 16:20.080
﻿But, anyway. Zabie's my friend.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.330
﻿Whether she's wearing pants or a skirt...

16:22.670 --> 16:24.590
﻿She's still a good friend.

16:24.670 --> 16:25.800
﻿And, that won't change.

16:27.800 --> 16:29.170
﻿Kennosuke...

16:30.510 --> 16:33.260
﻿Ma! Please, let us have dinner?

16:33.260 --> 16:36.100
﻿Let us in! We won't make any more noise!

16:36.100 --> 16:39.100
﻿Zabie, open up! Zabie! Come on

18:17.870 --> 18:20.530
﻿That was the miraculous dancing princess, Nadja!

19:26.140 --> 19:28.270
﻿I knew it. a skirt doesn't look good on me...

19:32.320 --> 19:34.730
﻿If you tell anyone, ANYONE, I'll get you!

19:39.070 --> 19:40.320
What is that?

19:55.920 --> 19:57.970
﻿Ah! I'm thirsty...

20:13.110 --> 20:14.570
﻿She's wearing that dress...

20:14.770 --> 20:16.730
﻿Ahh... that looks really great!

20:18.360 --> 20:19.820
﻿What are you doing?

20:20.360 --> 20:23.620
﻿Oh, dear! You used my things without permission?

20:23.870 --> 20:26.120
﻿Maybe I should tell everybody?

20:28.660 --> 20:29.620
﻿Fooled you!

20:30.370 --> 20:32.040
﻿I'll keep it a secret from the others.

20:33.040 --> 20:35.210
﻿Now, let's fix that funny face.

20:42.800 --> 20:43.930
﻿I said no!

20:43.930 --> 20:46.850
﻿If I go out there like this, everyone will laugh at me!

20:46.850 --> 20:48.930
﻿Nobody will laugh!

21:01.860 --> 21:03.530
﻿Zabie! It's Zabie!

21:03.530 --> 21:04.620
﻿What? Zabie?

21:04.620 --> 21:06.620
﻿The one that acts like a boy?

21:06.790 --> 21:07.700
﻿Everyone...

21:08.240 --> 21:09.410
﻿Everyone will laugh...!

21:09.830 --> 21:12.410
﻿Hey... it looks pretty good on you!

21:12.420 --> 21:14.040
﻿I almost didn't recognize you!

21:14.210 --> 21:15.210
﻿Kennosuke...

21:17.090 --> 21:19.920
﻿Of course, you'll ask me to dance first, right?

21:20.280 --> 21:21.070
﻿Yeah!

21:22.840 --> 21:24.050
﻿We'll dance, too!

21:24.930 --> 21:25.720
﻿Ask me to...!

21:26.300 --> 21:27.470
﻿Please, ask me to dance.

22:15.370 --> 22:18.620
Paris is sunnier than London

22:15.370 --> 22:18.620
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:18.740 --> 22:21.830
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

22:22.250 --> 22:28.420
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:22.250 --> 22:28.420
SUPEEDO no jou kimagure yasan

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
Indeed

22:29.380 --> 22:30.620
Kitto

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
It's not use worrying about it

22:33.380 --> 22:35.800
Nayan datte MUDA yo

22:36.380 --> 22:39.510
Que sera sera, sera Sera

22:36.380 --> 22:39.510
KE SERA SERA SERA SERA

22:39.770 --> 22:44.480
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:39.770 --> 22:44.480
Ashita nante itsumo naru you ni

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
To be, to be

22:44.560 --> 22:45.940
Naru naru

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
The tree fog won

22:46.270 --> 22:51.280
Sekai KAERU tobi KONKUURU

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
The world frog-jumping contest

22:51.740 --> 22:55.660
Yuushou shita yo AMAGAERU

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Under the kitten's paw

22:58.870 --> 23:05.040
Koneko chan no ashi no ura wa

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:05.460 --> 23:11.630
Otentou sama no nioi dane

23:14.470 --> 23:17.800
Paris is sunnier than London

23:14.470 --> 23:17.800
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

23:17.890 --> 23:20.890
CARUMEN men yori PAERIYA suki

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
It's not the time to hang around

23:21.390 --> 23:27.770
Michikusa shite iru baai ja nai ne

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Indeed, indeed

23:28.650 --> 23:33.150
Kitto kitto

23:41.500 --> 23:42.880
Tomorrow's Nadja

23:42.900 --> 23:44.270
﻿Even if I have to travel through a stormy night,

23:44.280 --> 23:45.530
﻿there's someone I want to see..

23:46.110 --> 23:48.700
